# Stage 4 (`authored-tests`) — controlled low-load rerun

## Method
Two runs of the SAME command (`bun run test`) on the SAME execution root
(`p09-chainA-work/execution-option-c-chainA-fixed3`), differing only in machine load.

- attempt 1: INVALID — bare shell PATH, no `haxe`; 3.08s; 937 pass/78 fail.
  Artifact of my mistake. Recorded in ATTEMPT-LOG.txt. NOT a reading.
- attempt 2 (this): toolchain PATH taken verbatim from the successful run's
  `evidence/env.json`; load 2.73 vs 6.25 for the harness run.

